<!--
  🔴 These are the ONLY driver-facing wording for a failure. The app never shows
  the server's own `message`: the backend speaks ar/en only, and a driver may be
  reading Urdu, Bengali or Hindi. A new error code is added here in ALL FIVE
  languages in the same change, or that driver is shown the generic line.

  ⏳ ur / bn / hi are written by the agent and still need a native speaker to
  read them before launch (CLAUDE.md, glossary).
-->
